            "count": 0,
            "is_markdown": true,
            "bug_id": 19066,
            "text": "Created attachment 3689\nExplicitly check and err for invalid dimensions in do_array.\n\nFor example:\n\n```\n> array(1, dim=NA)\nError in array(1, dim = NA) : negative length vectors are not allowed\n```\n\nNormally, trying to use NA for an arrays dimensions would give a more helpful error message like:\n\n```\n> attributes(x) <- list(dim = NA)\nError in attributes(x) <- list(dim = NA) :\n  the dims contain missing values\n```\n\nI've attached a patch that updates the error reporting in this scenario to match.",
            "creation_time": "2026-04-29T20:47:55Z",
            "creator": "kevinushey",
